          localized:
          - en:
              name: Rifle, hvy maser
              description: |-
                This weapon works on the same principles as the maser pistol, but adds greater range and full auto capability.
          - es:
              name: Rifle, hvy maser
              description: |-
                This weapon works on the same principles as the maser pistol, but adds greater range and full auto capability.
        rifle-maser:
          skill: Mod-rifle
          acc: '-2'
          md: F/B/A
          range: 60/120/400
          type: En/O
          damage: d6+2w/2d4+2w/d4+2m
          act: '4'
          clip: 90/30
          mass: '4'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '15000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Rifle, maser
              description: |-
                This is a smaller, more accurate, and less powerful version of the heavy maser rifle.
          - es:
              name: Rifle, maser
              description: |-
                This is a smaller, more accurate, and less powerful version of the heavy maser rifle.
heavy:
  config:
    default:
      columns:
        en:
        - name: Weapon
          key: name
        - name: Skill
          key: skill
        - name: Acc
          key: acc
        - name: Md
          key: md
        - name: Range (S/M/L)
          key: range
        - name: Type
          key: type
        - name: Damage (O/G/A)
          key: damage
        - name: Act.
          key: act
        - name: Clip
          key: clip
        - name: Mass
          key: mass
        - name: Hide
          key: hide
        - name: Avail
          key: avail
        - name: Cost ($)
          key: cost
        - name: Description
          key: description
          hidden: true
        es:
        - name: Arma
          key: name
        - name: Habilidad
          key: skill
        - name: Acc
          key: acc
        - name: Rango (P/M/L)
          key: range
        - name: Daño (O/G/A)
          key: damage
        - name: Acto.
          key: act
        - name: Acortar
          key: clip
        - name: Costo ($)
          key: cost
        - name: Descripción
          key: description
          hidden: true
        - name: Costo del clip
          key: clip_cost
          hidden: true
        - name: Esconder
          key: hide_modifier
          hidden: true
  items:
    pl-4-industrial-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 4: Industrial Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 4: Era industrial'
      items:
        flamethrower:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 6/12/30
          type: En/O
          damage: d6w/d6+3w/d8+3w
          act: '2'
          clip: '12'
          mass: '22'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Flamethrower
              description: |-
                This device consists of an incendiary fuel tank (worn slung across the back) and a gunlike nozzle and hose. The weapon projects a stream of ignited fuel that can hit a target as far away as 30 meters.<br />Fireproof or heat-shielded objects suffer half or no damage depending on the level of their protection. Flammable objects ignite and continue to burn for d6 rounds, suffering d4-2 points of wound damage each round or until the fire is extinguished. A flamethrower weighs 6 kg when its tank is empty.
          - es:
              name: Echador de llama
              description: |-
                Arma que proyecta una corriente de líquido inflamable encendido.
        grenade-frag:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4w/d4+2w/d6+2w
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '1'
          hide: '+2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '75'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, frag.
              description: |-
                The earliest version of this explosive device is difficult to throw accurately, but it can do formidable damage to anything that's nearby when it goes off. All targets within 2 meters of a frag grenade's explosion suffer Amazing damage (d6+2w); targets within 6 meters suffer Good damage (d4+2w); and targets within 10 meters suffer Ordinary damage (d4w). Anything farther than 10 meters away isn't affected by the blast.
          - es:
              name: Granada, fragmentación
              description: |-
                Granada de fragmentación diseñada para matar o herir al personal.
        machine-gun-30:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '0'
          md: A
          range: 60/200/600
          type: HI/O
          damage: d6w/d6+3w/d6m
          act: '4'
          clip: '50'
          mass: '10'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '2000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Machine gun, .30
              description: |-
                This fairly light, air-cooled machine gun came to prominence on battlefields of the era. The mechanism behind the machine gun is brilliant and simple: propellant and energy left over from expending a round of ammunition is used to load the next round into the chamber. It fires its bullets in rapid succession—much faster than a character could empty a single-shot gun.
          - es:
              name: Ametralladora, .30
              description: |-
                Un arma de fuego totalmente automática que dispara munición calibre .30.
        rocket-launcher:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: 30/60/150
          type: HI/G
          damage: d6w/d4+3w/d4m
          act: '1'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '5'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '1200'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Rocket launcher
              description: |-
                Introduced as an infantryman's antitank weapon, the shoulder-fired rocket launcher is also useful for busting bunkers and heavy fire support. Many PL 5 variations of this weapon (the LAW rocket, the RPG-7, etc.) also exist.
          - es:
              name: Lanzacohetes
              description: Un arma portátil capaz de disparar cohetes no guiados.
    pl-5-information-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 5: Information Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 5: Era de la información'
      items:
        grenade-launcher:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 50/200/350
          type: As load
          damage: As load
          act: '3'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '2'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '1000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade launcher
              description: |-
                While there are grenade launchers that mount on rifles, this item is a separate weapon specifically designed to fire small, explosive shells. The standard launcher can accommodate a variety of loads. The two basic types of launchers are the 40mm hand mortar and the 6x40mm six-shot launcher.<br />The hand mortar resembles a simple breech-loading, single-barreled shotgun. The six-shot looks like an oversized revolver mounted on a shotgun stock. Unlike the hand mortar, the six-shot can hold six grenades at once (but can only fire them one at a time). It also costs four times the listed price. In other ways, it's identical to the hand mortar.
          - es:
              name: lanzagranadas
              description: Un arma diseñada para disparar granadas.
        grenade-concus:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: LI/O
          damage: d6+2s/d4w/d4+1w
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '75'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, concus.
              description: |-
                The concussion grenade is basically a half-kilogram block of TNT in a cardboard wrapper. It has a pin and arm mechanism, but no fragmentation material. The concussion grenade is considered an offensive weapon, since it can be thrown by troops in open terrain without fear of causing themselves shrapnel damage.<br />All targets within 2 meters of a concussion grenade's explosion suffer Amazing damage (d4+1w); targets from 2 to 4 meters away suffer Good damage (d4w); targets from 4 to 6 meters away suffer Ordinary damage (d6+2s); and targets beyond 6 meters aren't damaged by the blast.
          - es:
              name: Granada, conmoción cerebral.
              description: |-
                Una granada que produce una poderosa onda de choque para aturdir o desorientar.
        grenade-incend:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/G
          damage: d4w/d4+2w/d4+3w
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '150'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, incend.
              description: |-
                This grenade releases a highly combustible chemical that ignites and throws shrapnel within a 6-meter radius.<br />All targets within 2 meters of an incendiary grenade's explosion suffer Amazing damage (d4+3w); those from 2 to 4 meters away receive Good damage (d4+2w); and those from 4 to 6 meters away receive Ordinary damage (d4w). Fireproof or heat-shielded objects suffer half or no damage depending on the level of their protection. Flammable objects ignite and continue to burn for d6+1 rounds, suffering d4-1 points of wound damage each round or until the fire is extinguished.
          - es:
              name: Granada, incendio.
              description: Una granada que inicia incendios y quema objetivos.
        grenade-smoke:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: Special
          damage: Special
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Con
          cost: '50'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, smoke
              description: |-
                This grenade releases a thick cloud of smoke that fills an area in a 6-meter radius around the explosion site. The smoke lasts for d8+4 rounds. It provides Good cover (+2 penalty to opponents' attempts to attack) and applies a +2 penalty to Awareness checks for all characters within the area of effect.<br />Some smoke grenades are filled with tear gas. Tear gas works just like smoke with the added benefit of partially incapacitating unprotected characters. Each individual in the area of effect makes a Constitution feat check to try to counter the effect of the gas: Critical Failure, helpless for 2d4 rounds; Failure, +3 penalty to all action checks and actions for 2d4 rounds; Ordinary, +2 penalty; Good, +1 penalty; Amazing, gas has no effect. Characters wearing e-suits or using respirator masks or oxygen tanks are unaffected by tear gas.
          - es:
              name: Granada, humo
              description: Una granada que crea una nube de humo para ocultarse.
        hvy-machine-gun:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '0'
          md: A
          range: 100/400/1000
          type: HI/G
          damage: d6+1w/2d4+2w/d8m
          act: '4'
          clip: '50'
          mass: '12'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '5000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Hvy machine gun
              description: |-
                This weapon type includes any of the large automatic weapons that use large-caliber rounds and require a mount to control the recoil. Without the use of such a mount, penalties for using automatic fire are doubled (+2/+4/+6 instead of the usual +1/+2/+3), the user must take an additional +1 penalty for lack of accuracy, and must make a successful Strength feat check to keep from being knocked down.
          - es:
              name: ametralladora hvy
              description: Una ametralladora de gran calibre.
        sam-handheld:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 1000/2000/4000
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4w/d6w/d6+4w
          act: '1'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '8'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '3500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: SAM, handheld
              description: |-
                This is a shoulder-fired surface-to-air missile with a heat-seeking head. When used against an airborne target that's giving off a significant amount of heat, the missile will circle around for a second attack one round later if it misses the target on its first pass.
          - es:
              name: SAM, portátil
              description: Un lanzador portátil de misiles tierra-aire.
    pl-6-fusion-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 6: Fusion Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 6: Era de la fusión'
      items:
        bantam-launcher:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 100/800/4000
          type: As load
          damage: As load
          act: '2'
          clip: '4'
          mass: '7'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '4000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Bantam launcher
              description: |-
                This portable launcher fires miniature bantam rockets. Braced on the shoulder and fired like a bazooka, the bantam launcher is light and easy to use. It has four chambers that can hold a variety of bantam rocket loads. The pistol grip has four triggers, one to activate each of the four load chambers, though only one trigger can be depressed at a time. The built-in guidance system makes this weapon accurate to extreme ranges.
          - es:
              name: lanzador gallo
              description: Un lanzador de misiles compacto.
        bantam-antiair:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '-2'
          md: F
          range: As launcher
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4w/d4+2w/d4m
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '3'
          hide: '+1'
          avail: Res
          cost: '1000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Bantam, antiair
              description: |-
                This projectile, about 0.5 meter long, has additional lift and guidance systems to lock onto and track low-flying aircraft. It can be triggered to seek a heat source such as a jet engine or to follow the commands of its user, who can direct it with a laser sight. The blast inflicts Amazing damage (d4m) within 4 meters of the explosion; Good damage (d4+2w) up to 8 meters away and Ordinary damage (d4w) out to 12 meters.
          - es:
              name: Gallo, antiaéreo
              description: Un misil gallo diseñado para apuntar a aviones.
        bantam-antiper:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: As launcher
          type: En/O
          damage: d6w/d6+2w/d8+2w
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '3'
          hide: '+1'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Bantam, antiper.
              description: |-
                This rocket delivers a low-level radiation burst designed to inflict maximum damage on people while leaving vehicles and buildings intact. Amazing damage (d8+2w) is inflicted within 4 meters of impact; Good damage (d6+2w) up to 8 meters; and Ordinary damage (d6w) out to 12 meters.
          - es:
              name: Gallo, antiper.
              description: Un misil gallo diseñado para apuntar al personal.
        bantam-antiveh:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '-2'
          md: F
          range: As launcher
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4+2w/d4+4w/d4+1m
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '3'
          hide: '+1'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '1000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Bantam, antiveh.
              description: |-
                This weapon is designed to hinder or destroy armored vehicles, but can also be used against bunkers and other hardened installations. It causes Amazing damage (d4+1m) to the target it impacts; Good damage (d4+4w) within 2 meters; and Ordinary damage (d4+2w) out to 4 meters away.
          - es:
              name: Bantam, antiveh.
              description: Un misil gallo diseñado para apuntar a vehículos.
        grenade-plasma:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/G
          damage: d4+2w/d6+2w/d4m
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Res
          cost: '400'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, plasma
              description: |-
                This is a more powerful version of the incendiary grenade. All targets within 2 meters of a plasma grenade's explosion suffer Amazing damage (d4m); those from 2 to 4 meters away suffer Good damage (d6+2w); and those from 4 to 8 meters away take Ordinary damage (d4+2w). Fireproof or heat-shielded objects suffer half or no damage, depending on the level of their protection. Flammable objects ignite and burn for d6+1 rounds, taking d4 points of wound damage per round or until the fire is extinguished.
          - es:
              name: granada, plasma
              description: Una granada que libera una ráfaga de plasma sobrecalentado.
        grenade-stun:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/O
          damage: d6s/d8s/d8+2s
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '250'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, stun
              description: |-
                The stun grenade creates a concussive wave that stuns those within the blast radius. All targets within 2 meters of the impact suffer Amazing damage (d8+2s); Good damage (d8s) is inflicted out to a distance of 4 meters; and Ordinary damage (d6s) extends to those up to 10 meters away.
          - es:
              name: Granada, aturdimiento
              description: |-
                Una granada diseñada para incapacitar objetivos sin matarlos.
        hvy-mach-gun-ch:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '-1'
          md: A
          range: 200/600/1200
          type: HI/G
          damage: d8w/2d6w/2d4m
          act: '4'
          clip: -/50
          mass: '45'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '10000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Hvy mach gun, ch
              description: |-
                This heavy machine gun makes use of charge technology to substantially improve upon the heavy machine gun of the previous era; this weapon has better range, stopping power, and accuracy. Without the use of a mount, penalties for automatic fire are doubled (+2/+4/+6), the user must take an additional +1 penalty for lack of accuracy (or disregard the weapon's accuracy bonus, if the optional rule is being used), and must make a successful Strength feat check to avoid being knocked down.
          - es:
              name: Hvy ametralladora, ch
              description: Una ametralladora pesada que dispara munición cargada.
        rail-gun:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '-1'
          md: B/A
          range: 150/500/1500
          type: HI/G
          damage: d6w/d6+2w/d6m
          act: '4'
          clip: -/30
          mass: '20'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '20000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Rail gun
              description: |-
                This weapon consists of a powerful electromagnetic accelerator that fires a stream of small projectiles at extremely high velocity.
          - es:
              name: Pistola de riel
              description: |-
                Un arma que utiliza rieles electromagnéticos para acelerar proyectiles a altas velocidades.
    pl-7-gravity-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 7: Gravity Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 7: Era de la gravedad'
      items:
        arc-gun:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '-1'
          md: F
          range: 20/40/100
          type: En/G
          damage: d8+1s/d8w/d6+3w
          act: '2'
          clip: '6'
          mass: '10'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '2000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Arc gun
              description: |-
                This is a weapon capable of delivering a powerful electrical shock in the form of a lightning bolt. The arc gun uses a built-in, low-powered laser beam to ionize the air between the weapon and its target, creating a path for the electrical arc. Because it requires air to operate, the weapon is useless in a vacuum.
          - es:
              name: pistola de arco
              description: Un arma que dispara un rayo de electricidad.
        cannon-stutter:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '-1'
          md: F
          range: 20/40/80
          type: LI/O
          damage: d6+2s/d8+3s/2d6+3s
          act: '1'
          clip: '2'
          mass: '15'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Con
          cost: '2500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Cannon, stutter
              description: |-
                A stutter cannon is a heavy weapon that consists of a backpack and attached gun. It is designed to disperse or otherwise handle a crowd without the use of lethal force. The stutter cannon produces compressed sonic waves that deliver hammerlike blows against targets. Each pulse affects all targets in a 3-meter radius.
          - es:
              name: Cañón, tartamudeo
              description: Un arma pesada no letal que altera el sistema nervioso.
        cannon-25mm-sabot:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 100/200/2000
          type: HI/G
          damage: d8w/d4+1m/d6+2m
          act: '2'
          clip: '20'
          mass: '10'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '10000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Cannon, 25mm sabot
              description: |-
                The backpack contains an electromagnetic accelerator that releases a powered 25mm projectile with amazing speed and force. The cannon's energy cell must be replaced after the weapon has fired two clips.
          - es:
              name: Cañón, zueco de 25 mm
              description: |-
                Un cañón pesado que dispara balas de sabot perforantes de 25 mm.
        grenade-pulse:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/G
          damage: d4+2s/d6+2s/d8+2s
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Res
          cost: '350'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, pulse
              description: |-
                This grenade consists of a powerful capacitor and a special ceramic shell that functions as a spherical antenna array. When it detonates, the capacitor releases a pulse of electromagnetic energy in the immediate area. This pulse can stun unprotected humans, but it's more useful for damaging electronic equipment—computers, sensors, vehicle control systems, servomotors, and the like. The discharge causes Amazing damage (d8+2s) within 2 meters; Good damage (d6+2s) out to 4 meters; and Ordinary damage (d4+2s) out to 10 meters.
          - es:
              name: Granada, pulso
              description: Una granada que emite un pulso cinético.
        grenade-tracer:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4+2w/d6+2w/d4+2m
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+3'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '350'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, tracer
              description: |-
                This is a smart shaped-charge grenade. Though it can be manually tossed or hurled by a launcher, once it reaches its target area it searches for a moving target to make contact with. Upon impact, the grenade explodes and releases its razor-sharp fragments. Amazing damage (d4+2m) is suffered by the target it impacts with (if any); Good damage (d6+2w) extends out to 2 meters; and Ordinary damage (d4+2w) extends to 4 meters. If no target is within 2 meters of its landing point, the grenade falls to the ground and waits up to 2 rounds for a target to approach within its detection range of 2 meters. If those 2 rounds go by without it being approached by a target the tracer grenade automatically deactivates. In such a case, it can be salvaged and reused.
          - es:
              name: Granada, trazador
              description: Una granada que marca objetivos para su seguimiento.
        plasma-gun:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 40/80/200
          type: En/G
          damage: d8w/d8+3w/d12+3w
          act: '2'
          clip: '8'
          mass: '6'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '12000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Plasma gun
              description: |-
                The plasma gun consists of a backpack and attached gun. Using a powerful electromagnetic accelerator, it throws blasts of superheated plasma generated by the delivery of an electrical shock to a large electrochemical shell.
          - es:
              name: pistola de plasma
              description: Un arma pesada que dispara rayos de plasma.
        quantum-mini:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '0'
          md: F/B/A
          range: 100/250/800
          type: En/G
          damage: d8+1w/d8+3w/d6m
          act: '4'
          clip: 90/30
          mass: '10'
          hide: '+1'
          avail: Res
          cost: '15000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Quantum mini
              description: |-
                This weapon adds a backpack accelerator to the quantum rifle, producing particle beams with longer range and more lethal force. All personal quantum weapons are extremely expensive and highly restricted, making them rare and often illegal to own and operate. Like the rifle, the minigun is capable of burst mode and autofire.
          - es:
              name: minicuántico
              description: Un arma cuántica miniaturizada.
        kz-160-13mm-charge-mg:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '-1'
          md: A
          range: 200/600/1200
          type: HI/G
          damage: d8w/2d6w/d8m
          act: '4'
          clip: 50 bursts
          mass: '22.5'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '9500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: KZ 160 13mm Charge MG
              description: |-
                The KZ 160 is a typical heavy charge machine gun, usually employed as a crew-served or vehicle-mounted weapon. Heroes who succeed on a Strength feat check can fire the KZ 160 from the hip at a +1 step penalty, but the double-autofire penalty doesn't apply to this weapon-the KZ 160 is a much lighter and steadier weapon than the standard heavy charge machine gun. (Payload: 13mm bullet)
          - es:
              name: Ametralladora de Carga KZ 160 13mm
              description: |-
                La KZ 160 es una ametralladora pesada en uso para un escuadrón completo o asalto en movimiento de vehículos. Un héroe que consiga una prueba de condición atlética en Fuerza podría poder sostener este arma con disparo a la cadencia base asumiendo un malus severo de retroceso de daño de zona. Es mucho más ligera y fiable que prototipos previos. (Carga: bala de 13mm)
        ronin-900-25mm-sabot-cannon:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: 100/200/500
          type: HI/G
          damage: d8w/d4+1m/d6+2m
          act: '2'
          clip: '20'
          mass: '10'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '10000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Ronin 900 25mm Sabot Cannon
              description: |-
                Designed to defeat vehicles and the best personal armor, the sabot cannon is the embodiment of raw firepower. Its oversized slug can punch gaping holes in almost anything. Its only weakness is its lack of accuracy compared to other heavy weapons-the sabot cannon's round has to make hard contact to inflict damage, and doesn't offer the wide beam of a plasma cannon or the fire volume of a machine gun. (Payload: 20mm sabot ramjet)
          - es:
              name: Cañón Sabot de 25mm Ronin 900
              description: |-
                Diseñado para destruir vehículos y los blindajes pesados; el cañón Sabot es el infierno volador para un regimiento de infantería común. Es capaz de dejar agujeros con estatuas en hormigón armado, sin embargo, debe hacer contacto directo de impacto para efectuar cualquier daño perjudicial, sin poseer ningún radio o foco de ráfagas expansivas. (Carga: estatorreactor sabot de 20mm)
        supernova-xi-mass-cannon:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 6/20/60
          type: En/G
          damage: d8+1w/d12+1w/d8+1m
          act: '2'
          clip: 8 shots
          mass: '8.75'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '6825'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Supernova XI Mass Cannon
              description: |-
                The mass cannon is something of a white elephant. While it's a powerful, hard-hitting gun, other heavy weapons hit just as hard with better range characteristics. The weapon's designers hoped to follow up on the success of its smaller cousins by designing a true man-portable antivehicular mass weapon, but they weren't able to achieve the kind of armor penetration increase they had hoped for. (Payload: Gravity point-source)
          - es:
              name: Cañón de Masa Supernova XI
              description: |-
                El cañón de masa es un arma estruendosa en el campo de batalla. Poderoso y demoledor pero su poco avance es innegable. Los diseñadores intentaban replicar una versión antílope de la armadura ligera en algo antivehicular portátil, pero sacrificando muchísimas características para ello dejándola en nicho. (Carga: Fuente puntual gravedad)
        roc-z1-stutter-cannon:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '-1'
          md: F
          range: 20/40/80
          type: LI/O
          damage: d6+2s/d8+3s/2d6+3s
          act: '2'
          clip: 10 shots
          mass: '15'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Con
          cost: '2500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Roc Z1 Stutter Cannon
              description: |-
                When it's important to subdue a number of people in a hurry, the stutter cannon is the best tool for the job. The cannon affects all targets in a 3-meter radius, inflicting damage one category less than the damage inflicted to the primary target. For example, if the user scores a Good hit (d8+3s) against one rioter, all other people within 3 meters suffer Ordinary damage (d6+2s). Ordinary hits inflict no damage to nearby targets. (Payload: Compressed air)
          - es:
              name: Cañón Stutter Roc Z1
              description: |-
                Herramienta definitiva de control de masas por repulsión. Afectando en un radio de 3 metros, sus ráfagas rebotan causando dolor secundario a cualquiera a merced. Los alcanzados en impacto de grado Bueno (d8+3s) salpicarán un impacto indirecto grado Ordinario de (d6+2s) a todos a 3m. El caso inferior no produce daño indirecto del todo. (Carga: Aire comprimido)
        dragon-3-heavy-flamer:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '-1'
          md: F/B/A
          range: 8/16/40
          type: En/G
          damage: d6+1w/d8+2w/2d6+1w
          act: '2'
          clip: 15 shots/5 bursts
          mass: '8.5'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '2400'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Dragon 3 Heavy Flamer
              description: |-
                A larger and more powerful version of the hand flamer, the heavy flamer's fuel tank is worn as a backpack unit. Its high-volume, high-pressure discharge can ignite even the most flame-resistant objects and personal armor. While it doesn't have the range of many other heavy weapons, in close quarters there are few weapons that match the sheer terror and destructiveness of a heavy flamer. (Payload: Incendiary stream)
          - es:
              name: Lanzallamas Pesado Dragon 3
              description: |-
                La versión enorme y brutal de un flamer. Su pesado tanque extra de mochila le otorga un volumen abismal, que puede ignorar chalecos ignífugos o armaduras personales inmolando a sus presas. Aunque no dispone del rango kilométrico de otras armas de su talla, la destrucción y purga en los pasillos de un crucero se vuelve un puro terror absoluto. (Carga: Chorro incendiario)
        d16-plasma-gun:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: 50/100/400
          type: En/G
          damage: d8w/d8+2w/d8+4w
          act: '2'
          clip: 8 shots
          mass: '6'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '12000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: D16 Plasma Gun
              description: |-
                The standard assault weapon of Orion League armored infantry, the D16 plasma gun is a spectacular weapon. Its massive energy discharge has a 2-meter area of effect. Anything in this area sustains damage one success grade lower than the damage inflicted to the point target, so if a plasma gun scores an Amazing hit, the target suffers d12+3w and anything else within 2 meters suffers a Good hit (d8+3w). (Payload: Incandescent plasma)
          - es:
              name: Cañón de Plasma D16
              description: |-
                Armamento de impacto estelar de la Liga armada de Orion, es espectacular. Expande su gran descarga unos 2 metros de asimilación circular. Quien esté dentro de esa zona recibe una herida que pendería ser el grado anterior al blanco. Si acierta a grado Increíble (d12+3w), su blanco lo asume per los compañeros sufren un ataque derivado grado Bueno (d8+3w). (Carga: Plasma)
        hak-59-quantum-minigun:
          skill: Heavy-direct fire
          acc: '0'
          md: F/B/A
          range: 40/80/200
          type: En/O
          damage: d8+1w/d8+3w/d6m
          act: '4'
          clip: 90 shots/30 bursts
          mass: '10'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '15000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: HAK-59 Quantum Minigun
              description: |-
                Also known as a particle gun or neutron gun, the quantum minigun produces beams of heavy, fast-moving subatomic particles that slag anything they hit. The minigun doesn't have the armor penetration capability of other heavy weapons, but its high rate of fire and high damage potential merit respect. The HAK-59 is currently in service in the Nariac Domain and with some VoidCorp troop formations. (Payload: Particle beam)
          - es:
              name: Minigun Cuántica HAK-59
              description: |-
                Conocida como arma protónica o de ráfaga cuántica, produce chorros láser pesados de subpartículas que desintegran un frente. Carece de la perforación de blindajes densos de otros rifles, pero su ratio de tiro salvaje lo soluciona escupiendo fuego hasta licuar formaciones tropas de élite en segundos y obligar al asedio Nariac a huir de contención. (Carga: Haz de partículas)
        zk5-grenade-launcher:
          skill: Heavy-indirect fire
          acc: '-1'
          md: F
          range: 40/240/480
          type: by warhead
          damage: by warhead
          act: '3'
          clip: 10 shots
          mass: '2'
          hide: '-2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '1500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: ZK5 Grenade Launcher
              description: |-
                The ZK5 (or 'Zeke 5' as it's known by the Concord Marines) is a modern version of the old grenade launcher. Its drum-style magazine holds ten 30mm grenades, smaller but more powerful than their historical counterparts. The Zeke launches its fin-stabilized warheads by means of a low-powered linear accelerator, a simple sabot gun with much better range and accuracy than the old hand mortars. (Payload: Various grenades)
          - es:
              name: Lanzagranadas ZK5
              description: |-
                El ZK5 (o cariñosamente "Zeke 5" por los Concord) es el pináculo de la lluvia de mortero portátil. Su cargador tambor tiene 10 depósitos de 30mm muy letales. Estabiliza ojivas finas de desaceleración lineal con un percutor base de disparo logrando unas arcas de trayectoria altísimas y lejanas mucho mejores a los lanzadores antiguos u obsoletos. (Carga: Granadas varias)
        bantam-5-rocket-launcher:
          skill: Heavy-indirect fire
          acc: '-2'
          md: F
          range: 40/400/2000
          type: by warhead
          damage: by warhead
          act: '2'
          clip: 4 shots
          mass: '7'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '4000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Bantam 5 Rocket Launcher
              description: |-
                The Bantam 5 handheld rocket launcher is basically a hollow tube with laser-designating sights for the guidance of bantam rocket rounds. The rockets can be guided by the launcher's sights, or a remote observer can use a separate laser designator to mark targets out of the firer's line of sight, allowing attacks over hills or around corners. (Payload: Various rockets)
          - es:
              name: Lanzacohetes Bantam 5
              description: |-
                El cohete lanza misiles Bantam 5 portátil es un tubo hueco pero con un inmenso designador de rastreo lateral y una mirilla inteligente guiada. El artillero designa su presa acorralándola a la condena, apuntando para rodear esquinas, colinas y saltar barreras. Incluso un observador remoto pasará láser de fijación a la ojiva para darle un trazo limpio. (Carga: Misiles varios)
        antiair-rocket:
          skill: n/a
          acc: n/a
          md: n/a
          range: por lanzador
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4w/d4+2w/d4m
          act: '-'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '3'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '1000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Antiair Rocket
              description: |-
                This bantam rocket features an IR guidance system and a fragmentation warhead to knock down enemy aircraft. (Payload: Serrated rod warhead) (Area of Effect: 4m/8m/12m)
          - es:
              name: Cohete Antiaéreo
              description: |-
                El cohete ligero cuenta con sistema infrarrojo guiado y una cabeza de fragmentación para tumbar aeronaves enemigas. (Carga: Varilla dentada) (Área de efecto: 4m/8m/12m)
        antipersonnel-rocket:
          skill: n/a
          acc: n/a
          md: n/a
          range: por lanzador
          type: En/O
          damage: d6w/d6+2w/d8+2w
          act: '-'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '3'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '500'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Antipersonnel Rocket
              description: |-
                Designed to knock out personnel without damaging vital equipment, the antipersonnel rocket delivers a deadly blast of neutron radiation on detonation. Like the antiair rocket, it's an area-effect weapon. (Payload: Neutron radiation) (Area of Effect: 4m/8m/12m)
          - es:
              name: Cohete Antipersonal
              description: |-
                Diseñado para aniquilar gente sin afectar al valioso equipo, asolando una mortífera onda de radiación a los que estén dentro de su detonación. Al igual que el antiaéreo, inflige en área. (Carga: Radiación de neutrones) (Área de efecto: 4m/8m/12m)
        antivehicle-rocket:
          skill: n/a
          acc: n/a
          md: n/a
          range: por lanzador
          type: HI/G
          damage: d4+2w/d4+4w/d4+1m
          act: '-'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '3'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '1000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Antivehicle Rocket
              description: |-
                This rocket delivers a discarding-sabot booster stage that can pierce very heavy armor. It's designed for use against light vehicles and heavy powered infantry. (Payload: Kinetic penetrator) (Area of Effect: contact/2m/4m)
          - es:
              name: Cohete Antivehículos
              description: |-
                Libera un disparador perforante sabot en fase capaz de cruzar las armaduras acorazadas de vehículos blindados o servos de infantería pesada con gran potencia. (Carga: Penetrador cinético) (Área de efecto: contacto/2m/4m)
        che-rocket:
          skill: n/a
          acc: n/a
          md: n/a
          range: por lanzador
          type: En/O or En/G
          damage: d8-2w/d8w/d4m
          act: '-'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '3'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '250'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: CHE Rocket
              description: |-
                This rocket is packed with a kilo of Detonex, one of the most powerful conventional explosives around. Its firepower is considered to be Good within 6 meters of the detonation point. (Payload: Detonex warhead) (Area of Effect: 6m/10m/16m)
          - es:
              name: Cohete CHE
              description: |-
                Empacado con Detonex. De los más populares y destructivos explosivos convencionales del cosmos. Su poder ardiente asolará a todo el que se le cruce a 6 metros redondos. (Carga: Ojiva de detonex) (Área de efecto: 6m/10m/16m)
        ap-grenade:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/G
          damage: d6-1w/d4m/d4+2m
          act: '2'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '400'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: AP Grenade
              description: |-
                This grenade's radar fuse senses its orientation to the target and creates a shaped-charge blast on contact. It is designed for piercing vehicular and body armor. (Payload: Directional charge) (Area of Effect: contact/1m/2m)
          - es:
              name: Granada AP
              description: |-
                Su espoleta de radar detecta dónde ubica a la víctima y asesta una carga concentrada sobre ella, ideada para destrozar armadura o armazones de vehículo. (Carga: Carga focalizada) (Área de efecto: contacto/1m/2m)
        concussion-grenade:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: LI/O
          damage: d6+3s/d6w/d6+2w
          act: '2'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '150'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Concussion Grenade
              description: |-
                This grenade is a block of explosive in a nonfragmenting case. It's designed to incapacitate instead of kill. (Payload: Caseless explosive) (Area of Effect: 2m/4m/6m)
          - es:
              name: Granada de Concusión
              description: |-
                Este cubo de bloque explosivo detona envuelto de un estuche no esparcible incapacitando e hiriendo al personal por impacto cinético sónico, limitando la limpieza de cadáveres letales. (Carga: Explosivo sin vaina) (Área de efecto: 2m/4m/6m)
        frag-grenade:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: HI/G
          damage: d8w/d8+1w/d4+1m
          act: '2'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '100'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Frag Grenade
              description: |-
                The fragmentation grenade is a very dangerous weapon, capable of hurling deadly shrapnel a great distance. Targets behind hard cover reduce the damage by one category, as if they'd hit the deck (see page 47 of the Alternity Gamemaster Guide). (Payload: Shrapnel) (Area of Effect: 2m/6m/10m)
          - es:
              name: Granada de Frag
              description: |-
                Peligrosa metralla punzante despedida desde escombros giratorios a gran distancia. Los protegidos tras una cobertura contundente restan el daño una categoría para simular que se tumban frente al daño y caen bajo suelo. (Carga: Metralla) (Área de efecto: 2m/6m/10m)
        gas-grenade:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: II/O
          damage: d4s/d4+2s/d4w
          act: '2'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '300'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Gas Grenade
              description: |-
                This weapon explodes in a cloud of poison gas 8 meters in diameter. This is a hemotoxin with an onset time of d4+1 rounds, and no modifier to the victim's Constitution feat check to resist its effects. See 'Poison' in Chapter 3 of the Alternity Gamemaster Guide for details. (Payload: Poison gas) (Area of Effect: contact/2m/4m)
          - es:
              name: Granada de Gas
              description: |-
                Estalla creando una nube a presión de gas paralizante hemotóxico a 8 metros. La toxina demora de media unos d4+1 asaltos en actuar, y no existe escudo a la Fortaleza de quien la respira. (Carga: Gas venenoso) (Área de efecto: contacto/2m/4m)
        pulse-grenade:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '0'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/G
          damage: d4+2s/d6+2s/d8+2s
          act: '2'
          clip: n/a
          mass: '0.5'
          hide: '+2'
          avail: Mil
          cost: '350'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Pulse Grenade
              description: |-
                The pulse grenade radiates a magnetic pulse on detonation, ionizing delicate electronics and interfering with victims' nervous systems. Against electronics, cybernetic targets, or powered armor, it inflicts maximum damage (6 stuns for an Ordinary hit, etc.). (Payload: Electromagnetic pulse) (Area of Effect: 2m/4m/10m)
          - es:
              name: Granada de Pulso
              description: |-
                La granada irradia impulsos magnéticos resecando e interfiriendo en el sistema nervioso humano y fundiendo material tecnológico. Máximo daño contra implantes cibernéticos, armas de energía y servomotores acoplados o armadura robótica (Impacto ordinario causa 6 de aturdimiento). (Carga: Pulso Electromagnético) (Área: 2m/4m/10m)
    pl-8-energy-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 8: Energy Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 8: Era Energética'
      items:
        bantam-starload:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '-2'
          md: F
          range: As launcher
          type: En/A
          damage: d8+2w/d4+1m/d6+1m
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '3'
          hide: '+1'
          avail: Res
          cost: '2000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Bantam, starload
              description: |-
                This projectile uses a miniature mass reactor to power an explosion, creating a blast that targets people and vehicles with ferocious punishment. The blast does Amazing damage (d6+1m) to anything within 6 meters; Good damage (d4+1m) out to 12 meters; and Ordinary damage (d8+2w) out to 20 meters.
          - es:
              name: Gallo, carga de estrellas
              description: Un misil gallo con una ojiva de alto rendimiento.
        cannon-maser:
          skill: Hvy-direct
          acc: '-1'
          md: F
          range: 80/200/600
          type: En/G
          damage: d8w/d4+1m/d6+2m
          act: '2'
          clip: '12'
          mass: '10'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '25000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Cannon, maser
              description: |-
                The maser cannon employs a miniature mass reactor and requires the use of a heavy backpack accelerator to supply the energy for maser blasts.
          - es:
              name: Cañón, máser
              description: Un cañón máser pesado.
        grenade-mass:
          skill: Athl-throw
          acc: '+1'
          md: F
          range: Per STR
          type: En/G
          damage: d6+2s/d6+2w/d6m
          act: '2'
          clip: '1'
          mass: '2'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '1000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Grenade, mass
              description: |-
                This grenade detonates a tiny mass reactor, resulting in a few cubic meters of cosmic catastrophe. Heat, light, and all forms of broadband electromagnetic radiation slag anything in the general vicinity of the grenade. All targets within 2 meters of the explosion suffer Amazing damage (d6m); Good damage (d6+2w) is inflicted on those within 4 meters; and Ordinary damage (d6+2s) is suffered by those within 10 meters of the blast.
          - es:
              name: granada, masa
              description: Una granada que utiliza campos de gravedad para causar
                daño.
        mass-launcher:
          skill: Hvy-indirect
          acc: '-1'
          md: F
          range: 20/300/1000
          type: En/G
          damage: d6+1w/d6+3w/d4+1m
          act: '1'
          clip: '4'
          mass: '15'
          hide: '-'
          avail: Res
          cost: '8000'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Mass launcher
              description: |-
                This indirect-fire weapon can only be used on a planetary surface, or in an artificial environment with at least light gravity. It launches a wave of gravity energy into the air and relies on the gravity well of a planet to both return the energy to the ground and magnify its power.<br />All targets within 4 meters of the blast suffer Amazing damage (d4+1m); targets within 8 meters suffer Good damage (d6+3w); and targets within 12 meters suffer Ordinary damage (d6+1w).
          - es:
              name: lanzador masivo
              description: Un lanzador que dispara proyectiles de masa.
ammunition:
  config:
    default:
      columns:
        en:
        - name: Item
          key: name
        - name: Platform
          key: platform
        - name: Payload
          key: payload
        - name: Cost ($)
          key: cost
        - name: Description
          key: description
          hidden: true
        es:
        - name: Objeto
          key: name
        - name: Plataforma
          key: platform
        - name: Carga
          key: payload
        - name: Coste ($)
          key: cost
        - name: Description
          key: description
          hidden: true
  items:
    pl-7-gravity-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 7: Gravity Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 7: Era de la gravedad'
      items:
        black-thunder-ap-round:
          platform: Any charge weapon
          payload: Sabot penetrator
          cost: 2x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Black Thunder AP Round
              description: |-
                The Black Thunder bullet is a discarding-sabot Teflon penetrator designed to pierce armor. This high-impact round halves the effect of any armor it strikes (round up). For example, attack armor normally stops d6+1 points of HI damage. If the d6 result is a 4, the armor stops a total of 5 points of primary damage against standard ammunition, but it only stops 3 points of damage (one-half of 5, rounded up) from a Black Thunder round. The damage roll of a sabot weapon using this round is reduced by 1 point, to a minimum of 1. Clips of AP ammo are twice as expensive as clips of normal ammo.
          - es:
              name: Muni. Perforante Trueno Oscuro
              description: |-
                El clásico penetrador de asalto de teflón para rajar armaduras. Cualquier blanco atravesado ve su coraza reducida a la mitad (Redondeando a su alza más próxima). Por poner ejemplo: Un blindaje medio detiene unos de bloque d6+1 impactos. Si sacamos 4 al d6 daría 5 contra municiones normales, que gracias al Trueno queda reducida a salvacargas de 3 en blindajes. Si el atacante que acerta portaba trueno oscuro el daño recibido al final resta 1 de golpe, minimizando su daño inicial pero destrozando gran armadura de una bala si el sujeto era blindado puro de pie a cabeza.
        mightymite-explosive-round:
          platform: Charge and sabot guns
          payload: Detonex warhead
          cost: 4x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: MightyMite Explosive Round
              description: |-
                Tipped with a Detonex-filled slug, the MightyMite explodes a split second after impact, causing ghastly wounds. If the bullet penetrates the target's armor (i.e., the target suffers primary wound or mortal damage from the attack), the exploding bullet inflicts d6-3 additional wound points that the victim's armor does not block.
          - es:
              name: Muni. Explosiva Potente MightyMite
              description: |-
                Forrado de esquirlas Detonex con explosión al chasquear impacto. El cuerpo abre una herida brutal de esquirla sangrante inminente de metrallas punzantes incrustadas en el riego. Si se perforó armadura el impacto sufre unos d6-3 de letalidad y herida extra que asimilan en carne ajena sin que la armadura lo proteja el añadido destructivo que se diseminará en sangre.
        archer-aa-stabilized-round:
          platform: Charge and sabot guns
          payload: Fin-stabilized sabot
          cost: 3x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Archer AA Stabilized Round
              description: |-
                This round is not rifled for spin-stabilization as most conventional slugs are; instead, it resembles a small aerodynamic dart, deploying small fins after leaving the barrel. It's extremely accurate, reducing penalties for medium- and long-range fire by 1 step.
          - es:
              name: Muni. Estabilizada AA
              description: |-
                No traza círculos ni derrape circular como cualquier proyectil clásico; se alinea asemejando a una flecha minúscula abriendo alas y engranaje estabilizante desde el interior. Precisión enorme y sublime restando penalización mediana ni larga a un único paso al que dispare.
        shredder-c5-flechette-ammo:
          platform: Charge guns
          payload: Flechette bundle
          cost: 2x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Shredder C5 Flechette Ammo
              description: |-
                This round converts a standard charge pistol or rifle into a flechette weapon. The weapon's range is reduced to 6/12/30 meters, and its damage to d4w/d6w/d4m, but its damage doubles for short-range shots. The Shredder C5 is popular for close-quarters fights, naturally; damage for long-range shots is reduced to one-half normal.
          - es:
              name: Munición de Flecha C5 Shredder
              description: |-
                Convertirá el arma que usas al de flechas de lluvia. Talla las variables limitándote de Rango corto, a de 6/12/30 y un daño fijo de d4w/d6w/d4m pero DUPLICA asertos e impactos cercanos. La flecha C5 es perfecta para pasillos navales estrechos y melé; mientras que las tiradas largas mermarán tu daño a la mitad ante esparcimiento.
        b-mace-gel-round:
          platform: Charge or sabot guns
          payload: Soft gel capsule
          cost: 2x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: B-Mace Gel Round
              description: |-
                Intended for nonlethal target subdual, the gel round converts any wound damage normally inflicted by the weapon to stun points, and any mortal damage to twice that number of stun points. The B-Mace suffers a +1 step penalty to long-range fire.
          - es:
              name: Bala de Gel A-Mace
              description: |-
                Gel de control letal civil. Asimila cualquier herida y absorbe su sangrado o muerte, pasando todos los restos de letal daño a doble impacto sumado aturdimiento de anestesia durmiente. El arma con Gel A-Mace pierde algo de aerodinámica e incuba maldad con retraso penalizador para impactables largos.
        talon-x-guided-round:
          platform: Charge or sabot guns
          payload: Laser-guided slug
          cost: 5x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Talon X Guided Round
              description: |-
                The Talon X guided round is necessary in order to take advantage of the Falcon X weapon guidance system (see previous section). A Talon X round is fitted with a laser-seeking head and aerofoils for in-flight course correction. Without guided ammo, the guidance system is useless.
          - es:
              name: Muni. Guiada X
              description: |-
                Balas guiadas de letal persecución unidas al sistema inteligente del sensor visual de miras X o rastreo manual. La Talon incorpora en puntera corrección telemétrica si ha fallado buscando su fin y redirigiéndose. Sin un guiado no resultará letal frente a nada y no funciona.
        snake-eyes-ir-homing-round:
          platform: Charge or sabot guns
          payload: Infrared-guided slug
          cost: 4x clip
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Snake Eyes IR Homing Round
              description: |-
                The infrared homing bullet is fitted with a tiny heat-seeking sensor in its head, adjusting its path to strike likely heat sources. It offers a -2 step bonus to medium- and long-range attacks, or a -1 step bonus to long-range attacks. If the attack skill check fails, the bullet locks on to some other likely heat source, and the user must then make a normal attack skill check against the alternate target. Sometimes this is another enemy nearby, but the Snake Eyes can't distinguish between friend and foe. (It's not a good round to fire into a area where friendlies are mixed up with hostiles.) If the second attack misses, too, the bullet doesn't endanger anyone else.
          - es:
              name: Casquillos Infrarrojo Snake Eyes
              description: |-
                Caza una presa buscándole el calor del motor de vehículos o de armadura del cuerpo orgánico. Da penalizador salvavidas -2 extra en mediana ni tan distante e invierte restando en rango extremo a un bono si se usa y un solo -1 lejano. Sus fallos no se dispersan ni erran: rastrea un segundo radar ajeno saltando de nuevo al compañero, o si atacas colisiona a otro calor cercano del que esté en esa sala. No distingue amigos de terroristas, pero si la segunda vez su tirada es fallo... el ojo de la serpiente errará ya del todo al fin colisionando estancado a tierra y suelo libre.
accessories:
  config:
    default:
      columns:
        en:
        - name: Item
          key: name
        - name: Platform
          key: platform
        - name: Mass
          key: mass
        - name: Cost ($)
          key: cost
        - name: Description
          key: description
          hidden: true
        es:
        - name: Objeto
          key: name
        - name: Plataforma
          key: platform
        - name: Masa (kg)
          key: mass
        - name: Coste ($)
          key: cost
        - name: Description
          key: description
          hidden: true
  items:
    pl-7-gravity-age:
      localized:
      - en:
          name: 'PL 7: Gravity Age'
      - es:
          name: 'PL 7: Era de la gravedad'
      items:
        falcon-x-guidance-system:
          platform: Any projectile (type HI) weapon
          mass: '0.1'
          cost: '1250'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Falcon X Guidance System
              description: |-
                This sighting system uses guided ammunition (see next page). It consists of a low-powered laser target designator on the weapon's barrel. Firing the weapon takes two actions—one to set up the shot, and the following to make the attack skill check. When the weapon is fired, the guided ammo homes in on the laser signal with pinpoint accuracy, conferring a -3 step bonus to the attack skill check. Naturally, the guidance system can be turned off to allow fire in the normal unguided mode.
          - es:
              name: Sistema Guía Falcon X
              description: |-
                El sistema fijador usa munición guiada. Incorpora una franja láser de baja densidad al barril y gastar un turno prepara su disparo para que, bajo su misma designación de puntería, trace y otorgue un bonificador extra de -3 nivel al disparo guiado infalible exacto. Este sistema puede apagarse para funcionar con normalidad.
        target-x-holo-sights:
          platform: Any ranged weapon
          mass: '0.1'
          cost: '850'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Target X Holo Sights
              description: |-
                The best long-range sights in production today, the Target X unit uses a sophisticated binocular apparatus to project a virtual crosshair. It works much like a telescopic sight, but with automatic rangefinding and no loss of peripheral vision. Holo sights reduce any range penalties for long-range fire by two steps. Note that a weapon can only have one set of sights installed.
          - es:
              name: Mirillas Holo Target X
              description: |-
                La mayor precisión óptica del siglo y los mejores visores en venta, cuenta con unas lentes de rastreo que miden telemetría con crucetas de fijación sin perder nada de visión o perimetral del arma. Su uso anula cualquier penalizador de larga distancia o disparos lejanos rebajándolo 2 pasos. Solo una de las miras puede ser acoplada al cañón.
        reaper-700-iff-sights:
          platform: Any ranged weapon
          mass: '0.1'
          cost: '850'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Reaper 700 IFF Sights
              description: |-
                IFF stands for Identify Friend or Foe, a system for preventing friendly casualties in combat. The user's allies must wear IFF transponders (a comm gear option costing $50) keyed to the right frequency in order for the system to function. If an ally is standing in the line of fire, the IFF sight prevents the gun from firing. It's extremely useful in close-quarters assaults, since a gunman can hose down a crowded room without fear of hitting his friends-ignore the normal risks of firing into a melee if the gunman's allies are wearing transponders.
          - es:
              name: Visor IFF  700 Reaper
              description: |-
                IFF sirve de Identificación Aliada / Enemiga, una capa protectora inteligente. Los miembros del pelotón emiten traspondedor IFF (Una de frecuencias comprada por 50$) ajustado al sistema en misma sintonía para que sea funcional. Si tu colega cruza la franja de combate, el arma de IFF bloquea el disparo al vuelo e imposibilita la muerte colateral accidental. Ideal asaltos confusos de cuartos donde se rocía pánico omitiendo miedo y penas al fuego general en área de melés y combate de cercanía ciega.
        mongoose-imaging-sights:
          platform: Any ranged weapon
          mass: '0.1'
          cost: '300'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Mongoose Imaging Sights
              description: |-
                This device is simply a light-intensifying scope mounted over the weapon's barrel. It reduces penalties for darkness by 2 steps, and penalties for long range by 1 step.
          - es:
              name: Mira Mongoose Imaging
              description: |-
                Lupa de barril muy sencilla y acoplable a cualquier ranura superior de fuego táctico que purifica la captación nocturna u opaca de luz redimiendo penalizaciones por ceguera y oscuridad en 2 puntos, y lejana de 1 rango extra.
        stealth-holster:
          platform: Any pistol or SMG
          mass: '1'
          cost: '400'
          localized:
          - en:
              name: Stealth Holster
              description: |-
                The stealth holster is made with antiscan material and molded to the user's body contours. It adds +3 steps to a weapon's Hide modifier, making it much less likely to be detected. Because the holster is often hidden in a hard-to-reach spot, the user suffers a +1 step penalty to his action check if he is attempting to draw his weapon in a hurry.
          - es:
              name: Funda de Sigilo Stealth
              description: |-
                Forjado con blindaje elástico material antiscáner se funde invisible con el trazo de cuerpo y forma anatómica para despistar miradas dando un modificador pasivo sigiloso de Ocultación de +3 al cuerpo y escurrir al cacheo y sensores de guardias, pero desenfundar desde ahí exige un pericia un engorro logrando +1 paso la penalización por desenfunde acelerado de saque instantánea.
